:: Statement-only formalization of Logipedia corpus artifact logic.not_to_not
:: (logipedia__mizar__logic.not_to_not), catalog title "logic.not_to_not":
:: contraposition for arbitrary propositions, where A implies B and not B
:: entail not A. This file contains no proof.

environ
begin

::$P-
scheme LogicNotToNot { A[], B[] } :
  (A[] implies B[]) implies
  ((not B[]) implies not A[])
proof
end;
::$P+
